<title>USA: Silicon Valley Bancshares CEO cuts stake.</title>
<headline>Silicon Valley Bancshares CEO cuts stake.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA CLARA, Calif. 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Silicon Valley Bancshares said Wednesday its president and chief executive John Dean and his wife gave 9,408 shares of the company's common stock to the Emmett R. Quady Foundation.</p>
<p>In a separate transaction, Dean sold 10,000 shares in connection with reducing a residential mortgage, the company said.</p>
<p>Dean might sell additional shares later this year in an effort to further reduce the same mortgage, it said.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
